# Installed agent tooling is a restorable dependency, not project source.
# `npx skills experimental_install` and `npx impeccable install --project`
# write ~12MB across three duplicated trees, most of it a platform binary and a
# font index. skills-lock.json pins the first set; the commands are in
# AGENTS.md. Restore, do not commit.
.agents/
.github/skills/
.github/agents/
.claude/skills/
.claude/agents/impeccable-*.md
